    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e45b663a5ff0a0ca494644</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 15:33:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Shiny，先后毕业于复旦计算机本科、剑桥MBA。有三个可爱的宝贝。曾任职于美国科技大厂，如今在泛心理教育领域创业，致力于将以正念为底色的生活哲学、家庭教育、女性疗愈成长的理念与方式传递给大家。此次访谈我们来聊聊她的人生职业转型和正念生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 我为什么非要循规蹈矩地活着？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 为什么选择在正念领域创业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 主业带娃，副业创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 关于我的创业项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 将源于东方的正念重新普及</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 爱发脾气的家长、整日焦虑的职场人，都来试试正念吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 什么是正念？它和冥想有区别吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 如何将正念融入到生活中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a> 正念如何帮助女性成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">52:25</a> 3分钟冥想小练习</span></p>]]></description>
