    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虞青，高考以山东省全省400名左右的高分考入中国政法大学，曾任律师两年，后转行为全职占星师。此次访谈，我们来聊聊她的职业转型道路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 为什么从律师转行全职占星师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 和玄学缘分的开端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 全职占星师的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 当兴趣变成职业，热爱还在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 未来的职业规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 玄学门派分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 玄学，现代人的精神春药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 玄学给我带来的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">46:21</a> 每个人一辈子能挣的钱是固定的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">51:05</a> 想转行/副业做玄学，该如何开始？</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信搜索公众号</span><strong><span>“独行有邻”（ID：duxingyoulin）</span></strong><span>关注我们</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>扫主理人二维码</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>加入职业转型与副业探索社群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Focv3FJaAsIl4J2unVBCAhANqJ4H.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
