    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从常春藤名校到纽约顶尖律所</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎料在工作第一年遭遇惊恐发作（panic attack）</span></p><span></span><p><span>裸辞从纽约逃回上海这期间有过迷茫、后悔、怀疑</span></p><span></span><p><span>但如今Zoe已找到内心的平静、喜悦和满足</span></p><span></span><p><span>更笑称现在是人生巅峰本期采访，我们聚焦Zoe放下精英光环的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频最后还有她的一些干货分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>包括毕业生选择律师还是法务，不要错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;收听本期音频，解锁完整档案 -</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>人生经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> </span></strong><span>资本市场律师社畜的日常</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a></span></strong><span> 某个习以为常的加班夜，心跳加速、呼吸困难、手臂麻痒——心脏病？Panic Attack!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> </span></strong><span>压垮Zoe的最后一根稻草，裸辞！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a></span></strong><span> 从年薪百万到月入过万——这是不是一个错误的决定？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a></span></strong><span> 放下精英光环，与自己和解</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> </span></strong><span>为什么选择药企法务</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> </span></strong><span>不后悔，现在就是人生巅峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>干货分享</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a></span></strong><span> 毕业生选择律师vs.法务的利与弊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a></span></strong><span> 药企法务的日常</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>人物档案</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvVD5NM5M3fPo2HbVt4lLhRbLw2K.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>来聊&amp;联系我们</span></strong></h2><span></span><f